            "review_title": "Review at Fusion Sushi House",
            "review_text": "molove2\nCambridge, United Kingdom8 contributions\n1\nLovely Japanese inspired food\nOct 2022\nMy wife and I really fancied some sushi whilst we were on holiday in Hanoi. I had a search on Google maps to see if there was anywhere near our hotel and luckily Fusion Sushi House was really close. The food on their menu on their website looked delicious. \nWe visited early on a Thursday evening, the staff member on duty was friendly and polite and luckily for us, spoke really good English. \nThe food we ordered was delicious. we had the beef negimaki, spicy tuna Korean tacos, salmon teriyaki, sesame sake carpaccio and some sushi and tofu.\nWe were the only people there when we went which is a real shame because the food was really nice and they deserve to be much busier!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten October 17, 2022\nTùng\nThank You so much for visiting!\nWritten October 23, 2022\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
